{"number":1501,"title":"A retrospective lane for larger designs: a week after it works as planned, ask whether it is working","body":"verify-in-production files *point assertions* — &#34;artifact X reads Y once Z is live&#34; — which fits a minor feature. A larger system element needs a second, later follow-up the corpus has no lane for: roughly a week after everything works *as planned*, a review asking **is it working, is it misused, is it overused, is it underused**, against its real production record.

The gap is proven by its own subject: the VIP mechanism itself ran 10 days in production accumulating stranded items, wrong janitor closes, and divergent converge improvisations, and was reviewed only because the owner remembered to ask (2026-08-31 review; findings #1497, #1498, and siblings). The basics pack&#39;s own rule says a follow-up must be a mechanism that comes back on its own, never a human&#39;s memory.

Proposal: when a larger design lands (a migration plan&#39;s tracking issue closes, or a design doc merges), file a `Design retrospective: ` issue on the same ad-hoc lane — `Not-before:` ~1 week out, the four questions plus the element&#39;s design doc as the brief, findings filed as issues. The verify-in-production and writing-migration-plans skills would name the trigger.","state":"open","html_url":"https://github.com/missingbulb/Claudinite/issues/1501","user":{"login":"missingbulb","id":73882448,"profile_url":"https://github.com/missingbulb","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73882448?v=4"},"author_association":"OWNER","assignees":[],"reactions":{"total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"created_at":"2026-08-31T09:48:27Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T09:48:27Z","has_parent":false,"has_children":false,"closed_by_pull_requests":{"total_count":1,"references":[{"number":1502,"title":"basics: a larger element schedules its production retrospective","state":"OPEN","url":"https://github.com/missingbulb/Claudinite/pull/1502","repository":"missingbulb/Claudinite"}]}}

